# Car Guy — environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. Expo inlines every variable
# whose name starts with EXPO_PUBLIC_ into the JavaScript bundle, so only
# public-safe values belong here.
#
# Both values come from the Supabase project `x-core`:
#   Project Settings → API → Project URL, and the `anon` / publishable key.
#
# The anon key IS public. It identifies the project, not a person, and every
# table in schema `carguy` is behind row level security keyed on auth.uid()
# (sql/003_rls.sql), so holding the key grants nothing without a session.
# The service-role key must NEVER appear in this repo (04-conventions.md).
#
# With these unset the app runs exactly as before — no account, no sync, all
# data local. That is a supported state, not a broken one (ADR-05).

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY
